SUMMARY:Vienna Royal Orchestra: Viva Mozart 270
LOCATION:Cerritos Center for the Performing Arts
DESCRIPTION:Matthew Busse\, Conductor Tian Jiang\,Piano Patrick Rafter\, Vi
 
olin Shay Mowbray\, piano Anson Wong\, piano From Carnegie Hall to Jacobs M
 
usic Center... Following its New York performance this summer at Carnegie H
 
all\, the Vienna Royal Orchestra brings its VIVA MOZART 270 celebration to 
 
Cerritos Center for the Performing Arts in Los Angeles area. This special c
 
oncert honors the 270th anniversary of the birth of Wolfgang Amadeus Mozart
 
\, one of history's most beloved and influential musical geniuses. Audience
 
s will enjoy an inspiring program of Mozart's timeless masterpieces\, perfo
 
rmed by distinguished musicians from Europe and the United States. Internat
 
ionally celebrated pianist Tian Jiang appears as soloist in Mozart's Piano 
 
Concerto No. 23 in A Major\, K. 488. Praised as "a thoughtful interpreter" 
 
by The New York Times and "a deeply persuasive Mozartean" by The Los Angele
 
s Times\, he is recognized for performances that combine poetic artistry\, 
 
technical mastery\, and expressive depth. Tickets & info: https://www.ticke
 
tmaster.com/vienna-royal-orchestra-viva-mozart-270-cerritos-california-10-1
 
5-2026/event/0B0064DDE4D84BA4
URL:https://www.ticketmaster.com/vienna-royal-orchestra-viva-mozart-270-cer
 
ritos-california-10-15-2026/event/0B0064DDE4D84BA4
END:VEVENT
